# LegendaryMissions LORE - the in-game reading, not the machinery.
#
# Split out of the `documents` addon so a mission can build on LM's document/quest
# SCREENS without inheriting LM's fiction: Storm's Beacon loads documents for the
# renderer and the quest log, and used to get a Zunok galactic helpfile with them.
# Content is a separate addon for the same reason LM's maps are not in an addon at all.
#
# Registering is all there is to it - `lore_register` is what makes the Library tab
# exist, so a mission that omits this addon has no LM chapter and, if nothing else
# registers, no Library at all.
lore_register("lm", "A Zunok's Galactic Helpfile", "library_docs.amd")
